<xt>
  <head>
    <!-- Layout template: inventory, 1280 x 720 (docs/design/30-ui-project.md 30.2 class 4).
         Most surveyed inventory screens are three-zone "mixed" layouts (79 %,
         docs/reference/ui-survey-2026-09/report.md): list or grid on the left, the character or
         item model in the middle, details on the right.
           Header    Tabs (categories) and currency Counter
           List      item grid (`<repeat>` of item cells, virtualized)
           Model     `<external source="scene-view:inventory">` or item art
           Details   name, stats (ProgressBar), actions (Button)
           Footer    input hints (InputGlyph)
         Replace the guide boxes with standard symbols. -->
    <style>
      body { width: 100vw; height: 100vh; font-family: var(--font-family); }
      #Screen { position: relative; width: 100vw; height: 100vh; overflow: hidden; }
      .anchor {
        position: absolute;
        display: flex;
        border-width: var(--border-w);
        border-color: var(--color-border);
        border-radius: var(--radius-s);
      }
      .guide { color: var(--color-text-dim); font-size: var(--font-size-xs); padding: var(--space-1); }
      #Header { left: var(--safe-x); top: var(--safe-y); width: 1216px; height: 56px; }
      #List { left: var(--safe-x); top: 96px; width: 420px; height: 540px; }
      #Model { left: 468px; top: 96px; width: 400px; height: 540px; }
      #Details { right: var(--safe-x); top: 96px; width: 364px; height: 540px; }
      #Footer { left: var(--safe-x); bottom: var(--safe-y); width: 1216px; height: 32px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div id="Screen">
      <div id="Header" class="anchor"><span id="HeaderGuide" class="guide">Header</span></div>
      <div id="List" class="anchor"><span id="ListGuide" class="guide">List</span></div>
      <div id="Model" class="anchor"><span id="ModelGuide" class="guide">Model</span></div>
      <div id="Details" class="anchor"><span id="DetailsGuide" class="guide">Details</span></div>
      <div id="Footer" class="anchor"><span id="FooterGuide" class="guide">Footer</span></div>
    </div>
  </body>
</xt>
